  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Heap buffer overflow in RainerScript replace()\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-78002.patch: rewind the sizing pass by the\n       full failed partial-match length in doFuncReplace() in\n       grammar/rainerscript.c, so the allocated result matches what the\n       copy pass writes\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-78002-tests.patch: add regression test\n       tests/rscript_replace-overlap.sh covering replace() with an\n       overlapping partial match (the overflow trigger)\n     - CVE-2026-78002",
